<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-06T00:28:21.594Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:28:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces demolished homes in Biddu, displacing more than 100 Palestinians, while settlers rebuilt a West Bank outpost on a Palestinian family's land and Palestinians harvested olives under Israeli military restrictions. Tony Blair met Netanyahu and Herzog to advance a Gaza plan, and Ra’am chief Abbas declined to label Hamas a terror group, citing family safety concerns. Meanwhile, gunfire damaged tents at the Rafah displacement site and Israeli attacks killed four people, including a child, as Gaza held a tournament final honoring over 1,000 slain athletes. 21,440 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/5/arab-party-backs-eisenkot-in-bid-to-form-israels-next-government?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/world/middleeast/israel-election-herzog-prime-minister-meetings.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOU3dSLTc0WVkyMnRDQ0xIaWxzWFpPSXRQc2tady1XVEdjbnF6dHViSU9kdmg5QXR1bVNoRVFiR0dnVFIzNHVvQjBERVpteS1PM2xvNDhIT2s1dnBjN2hqWHktSVd5cFV3ZWZwX2JZVlJSMlZkaGstRExjRFlscGpvVTlOM2pCd29wVEd3em1jVVRuWXRhZ1BKUXBZY3ZZOGhod1NZQWwzaUJYNnVWc2tCRnpVY2p1QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTFBrY3VQNVFQTTlwbmtGU2lnTU82djJTQkcxdTBiVEZlWkt4VXR6QjBvU1FGQm9wYXBYdk1LenhxR3lISWJLWDlMUFBQZUl5SWk1VjRzZU8xVTJGUTBURW1JTWtmMjE2NUJmczdEcA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/world/europe/finland-fitburg-russia-s